#: filteropts.cpp:48
msgid "Under Construction..."
msgstr "Onder Konstruksie..."

#: main.cpp:59
msgid "&Filters"
msgstr "Filters"

#: main.cpp:118
msgid ""
"<h1>Enhanced Browsing</h1> In this module you can configure some enhanced "
"browsing features of KDE. "
"<h2>Internet Keywords</h2>Internet Keywords let you type in the name of a "
"brand, a project, a celebrity, etc... and go to the relevant location. For "
"example you can just type \"KDE\" or \"K Desktop Environment\" in Konqueror "
"to go to KDE's homepage."
"<h2>Web Shortcuts</h2>Web Shortcuts are a quick way of using Web search "
"engines. For example, type \"altavista:frobozz\" or \"av:frobozz\" and "
"Konqueror will do a search on AltaVista for \"frobozz\". Even easier: just "
"press Alt+F2 (if you haven't changed this shortcut) and enter the shortcut "
"in the KDE Run Command dialog."
msgstr ""

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:124
msgid "Enable &Web shortcuts"
msgstr "Aktiveer Web kortpaaie"

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:126
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, KDE will let you use the shortcuts defined below to "
"quickly search the Internet. For example, typing the words "
"<em>shortcut</em>:<em>KDE</em> will result in the word <em>KDE</em> being "
"searched using the URI defined by the <em>shortcut</em>."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie boks is nagegaan, Kde sal laat jy gebruik die kortpaaie "
"gedefinieër onder na vinnig soektog die Internet. Vir voorbeeld, te tik die "
"woorde <em>kortpad</em>:<em>Kde</em> sal resultaat in die woord <em>Kde</em>"
" te wees gesoekte te gebruik die Uri gedefinieër deur die <em>kortpad</em>."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:134
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naam"

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:135
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "Kortpaaie"

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:137
msgid ""
"This list contains the search providers that KDE knows about, and their "
"associated pseudo-URI schemes, or shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie lys bevat die soektog verskaffers wat Kde weet aangaande, en hulle "
"geassosieer pseudo-URI skemas, of kortpaaie."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:151
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Voeg by..."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:152
msgid "Click here to add a search provider."
msgstr "Kliek hier na voeg by 'n soektog verskaffer."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:155
msgid "Change..."
msgstr "Verander..."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:156
msgid "Click here to change a search provider."
msgstr "Kliek hier na verander 'n soektog verskaffer."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:161
msgid "Click here to delete the currently selected search provider from the list."
msgstr "Kliek hier na uitvee die huidiglik gekose soektog verskaffer van die lys."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:183
msgid ""
"In this module, you can choose whether to use Internet Keywords or not. You "
"can also configure various Internet search engines that KDE can use for "
"keyword search. This allows you, for example, to enter a pseudo-URI like "
"gg:smetana to search the Google search engine for web pages about the Czech "
"composer Bedrich Smetana."
msgstr ""
"In hierdie module, jy kan kies hetsy na gebruik Internet Sleutelwoorde of "
"nie. jy kan asook konfigureer verskeie Internet soektog enjins wat Kde kan "
"gebruik vir sleutelwoord soektog. hierdie laat toe jy, vir voorbeeld, na "
"invoer 'n pseudo-URI hou van gg:Smetana na soektog die Google soektog "
"masjien vir web bladsye aangaande die Tsjeggië saamsteller Bedrich Smetana."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:410
msgid "Importing Search Providers is not implemented yet."
msgstr "Met die invoering van Soektog Verskaffers is nie geimplementeer nog."

#: plugins/ikws/ikwsopts.cpp:415
msgid "Exporting Search Providers is not implemented yet."
msgstr "Uitvoer van Soektog Verskaffers is nie geimplementeer nog."

#: plugins/ikws/kurisearchfilter.cpp:73
msgid "&Keywords"
msgstr "Sleutelwoorde"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:46
msgid "Search &provider name:"
msgstr "Soektog verskaffer naam:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:50
msgid "Enter the human readable name of the search provider here."
msgstr "Invoer die menslik leesbaar naam van die soektog verskaffer hier."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:54
msgid "Search &URI:"
msgstr "Soektog Uri:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Enter the URI that is used to do a search on the search engine here.\n"
"The whole text to be searched for can be specified as \\{@} or \\{0}.\n"
"Recommended is \\{@}, since it removes all query variables (name=value) from "
"the resulting string whereas \\{0} will be substituted with the unmodified "
"query string.\n"
"You can use \\{1} ... \\{n} to specify certain words from the query and "
"\\{name} to specify a value given by 'name=value' in the user query.\n"
"In addition it is possible to specify multiple references (names, numbers "
"and strings) at once (\\{name1,name2,...,\"string\"}).\n"
"The first matching value (from the left) will be used as substitution value "
"for the resulting URI.\n"
"A quoted string can be used as default value if nothing matches from the "
"left of the reference list."
msgstr ""
"Invoer die Uri wat is gebruik word na doen 'n soektog op die soektog masjien "
"hier.\n"
"die volledige teks na wees gesoekte vir kan wees gespesifiseer as \\{@} van "
"\\{0}.\n"
"Aanbeveel is \\{@}, sedert dit verwyder alle navraag veranderlikes "
"(naam=waarde) van die gevolglik string darenteen \\{0} sal wees vervang met "
"die ongemodifiseerde navraag string.\n"
"Jy kan gebruik \\{1} ... \\{n} na spesifiseer sekere woorde van die navraag "
"en \\{naam} na spesifiseer 'n waarde gegewe deur 'naam=waarde' In die "
"gebruiker navraag.\n"
"In byvoeging dit is moontlik na spesifiseer veelvuldige verwysings (name, "
"nommers en stringe) na as eers (\\{name1,name2,...,\"string\"}).\n"
"die eerste ooreenstemmende waarde (van die links) sal wees gebruik word as "
"substitusie waarde vir die gevolglik Uri.\n"
"'n aangehaalde string kan wees gebruik word as verstek waarde as niks "
"ooreenstemmende inskrywings van die links van die verwysing lys."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:69
msgid "UR&I shortcuts:"
msgstr "Uri kortpaaie:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:73
msgid ""
"The shortcuts entered here can be used as a pseudo-URI scheme in KDE. For "
"example, the shortcut <em>av</em> can be used as in <em>av</em>:<em>my "
"search</em>."
msgstr ""
"Die kortpaaie ingevoerde hier kan wees gebruik word as 'n pseudo-URI skema "
"in Kde. Vir voorbeeld, Die kortpad <em>av</em> kan wees gebruik word as in "
"<em>av</em>:<em>my soektog</em>."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:77
msgid "&Charset:"
msgstr "Karakterstel:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:81
msgid "Select the character set that will be used to encode your search query."
msgstr ""
"Kies die karakter stel wat sal wees gebruik word na enkodeer jou soektog "
"navraag."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:96
msgid "Modify Search Provider"
msgstr "Verander Soektog Verskaffer"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:106
msgid "New Search Provider"
msgstr "Nuwe Soektog Verskaffer"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:123
msgid ""
"The URI does not contain a \\{...} placeholder for the user query.\n"
"This means that the same page is always going to be visited, regardless of "
"what the user types..."
msgstr ""
"Die Uri doen nie bevat 'n \\{...} plekhouer vir Die gebruiker navraag.\n"
"Hierdie beteken wat Die selfde bladsy is altyd gaan na wees besoekte, ongeag "
"van wat Die gebruiker tipes..."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:126
msgid "Keep It"
msgstr "Hou Dit"

